<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ar" dir="rtl">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>تسجيل الدخول - متجر ميرا</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/css/bootstrap.rtl.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.5.1/css/all.min.css">
    <style>
        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e293b 100%);
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
        }
        .login-card {
            max-width: 440px;
            width: 100%;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
            background: #fff;
            padding: 35px;
        }
        .logo-box {
            width: 65px;
            height: 65px;
            border-radius: 16px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            margin: 0 auto 15px auto;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.35);
        }
        .form-control {
            border-radius: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #cbd5e1;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .form-control:focus {
            border-color: #2563eb;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.15);
        }
        .btn-primary {
            background: #2563eb;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 12px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-1px);
        }
        .quick-btn {
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 10px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        .quick-btn:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="login-card">
        <div class="logo-box">
            <i class="fas fa-store"></i>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-center fw-bold text-dark mb-1">تسجيل الدخول</h3>
        <p class="text-center text-muted mb-4 small">أهلاً بك مجدداً في متجر ميرا الإلكتروني</p>

        <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined' && error) { %>
            <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 px-3 small text-center mb-3" role="alert">
                <i class="fas fa-exclamation-triangle me-1"></i> <%= error %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <form method="POST" action="/login.php">
            <div class="mb-3">
                <label for="username" class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">اسم المستخدم</label>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0"><i class="fas fa-user text-muted"></i></span>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control border-start-0" id="username" name="username" placeholder="أدخل اسم المستخدم" required value="admin">
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mb-4">
                <label for="password" class="form-label fw-bold small text-muted">كلمة المرور</label>
                <div class="input-group">
                    <span class="input-group-text bg-light border-end-0"><i class="fas fa-lock text-muted"></i></span>
                    <input type="password" class="form-control border-start-0" id="password" name="password" placeholder="أدخل كلمة المرور" required value="admin123">
                </div>
            </div>

            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary w-100 mb-3">
                <i class="fas fa-sign-in-alt me-1"></i> دخول
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="border-top pt-3 mt-3">
            <div class="text-center text-muted small mb-2 fw-bold">الدخول السريع بنقرة واحدة:</div>
            <div class="d-grid gap-2">
                <a href="/switch-role?role=admin" class="quick-btn btn btn-outline-primary">
                    <i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i> الدخول كـ مدير (Admin) مباشرة
                </a>
                <a href="/switch-role?role=user" class="quick-btn btn btn-outline-secondary">
                    <i class="fas fa-user"></i> الدخول كـ زبون عادي (User)
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center mt-3 pt-2 text-muted" style="font-size: 0.8rem;">
            بيانات تجريبية: المدير (admin / admin123) - المستخدم (user / user123)
        </div>
    </div>
    <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
